.TH PORTAL 1 "August 2026" "portal" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
portal \- Telegram to Delta Chat media bridge
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B portal
[\fIoptions\fR] \fIcommand\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Portal bridges Telegram and Delta Chat for text, stickers, GIFs, images,
and short video. Pairing is per user. This software is beta; use at your own risk.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B serve
Start the bot (Telegram long-poll and Delta Chat).
.TP
.B init \fIqr\fR
Configure a new Delta Chat account from a dcaccount: or dclogin: URI.
.TP
.B link
Print the Delta Chat invite for the bot account.
.TP
.B list
List Delta Chat accounts in the data folder.
.TP
.B completion \fIshell\fR
Write completion script for bash, zsh, or fish.
.TP
.B version
Print the binary version.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " " \fIpath\fR
YAML config (default config.yml).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-folder " " \fIpath\fR
Data directory (default ./data or folder in the config).
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-account " " \fIid\fR
Limit some commands to one Delta Chat account id.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/portal/config.yml
Packaged config path.
.TP
.I /etc/portal/env
Secrets. Mode 0640. Not in git.
.TP
.I /var/lib/portal
Default data directory for the systemd unit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
Portal BotFather token.
.TP
.B PERSONA_ACCOUNT_QR
URI used to create ghost Delta Chat accounts.
.TP
.B TGPORTAL_DB_KEY
32-byte hex key when database encryption is on (legacy name).
.TP
.B INVITE_URL
Optional admin Delta Chat invite for the boot message.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/omidz4t/portal
.SH BUGS
Beta. The host can read bridged traffic.
